From: "HT9045 Machine (V906)" <Claude_RDBC_02@honprec.com>
Date: Wed, 30 Sep 2026 23:41:48 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] HTDESIGNER-108: the DFM list folded only behind the editable
 grid (0.108.0)

Since 0.102 the DFM list and the HTML are folded by default. For a component with
no editable grid (made by the page's JS, not in the source) that left the
properties list with two folded headings and nothing else -- it looked empty.
Now the default fold applies only when the editable grid is there; otherwise the
DFM list opens (the user's own open / fold is still remembered).

Tests (all 4 layers pass: lib 162, smoke 187, panels, real VS Code 159):
panels (XST1's data, no editable grid: the DFM list open).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
